---
// Download section - release links and source code
---

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
  <div class="reveal panel-gradient-strong rounded-2xl border border-border p-10 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Get Sanctum</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">
      Download the desktop vault or browse the source. Sanctum Web is a companion, not a cloud.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://codeberg.org/Kyronix/Sanctum/releases"
        class="btn-gradient shadow-glow rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition hover:brightness-110"
      >
        Desktop Releases
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://codeberg.org/Kyronix/Sanctum"
        class="rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 transition hover:border-[#ff2ac3]/60 hover:text-white"
      >
        View Source
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
